# Harness / agent local dirs — operator-owned. The one tracked file under
# .claude/ is settings.local.json: the Claude cloud-session hook carrier
# (scripts/claude-cloud-hook.sh). A file inside an ignored directory cannot be
# re-included, so the directory is ignored by contents (.claude/*).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.local.json
.grok/
.cursor/
.pi/

# satelle process substrate (.satelle/) is tracked: workflows, skills,
# principles, constitution, satelle.toml, task definitions and documents.
# Its machine-local and runtime parts are not (sty_3f91b9e2). The re-include
# overrides a machine-wide core.excludesFile that ignores .satelle/.
!.satelle/
.satelle/**/.env
.satelle/logs
.satelle/hooks
.satelle/deployed.version
.satelle/*.local.toml
.satelle/tasks/*/exe_*.md

# Built binaries — leading `/` is required so only the *named path* is ignored.
# A bare `satelled` would also match cmd/satelled/ and hide the source.
/satelle
/satelled
/satelle-serve
/cmd/satelle/satelle
/cmd/satelled/satelled

# Opt-in live benchmark output (generated evidence, not source fixtures).
/tests/plannerbench/out/

# >>> satelle (managed) >>>
# RECOMMENDED defaults — the operator owns .gitignore. .satelle is git-optional
# overall (continuity is local disk or personal rehydrate). When a team tracks
# process under .satelle, workflows/agents.toml is intended to be committed
# (roles workflows name; sty_552d2d87) — it is deliberately NOT listed below;
# its machine-local twin, agents.local.toml, is.
# Execution detail belongs in ~/.satelle/agents.toml; secrets in satelle.local.toml.
# Continuity is local disk by default; once the repo is bound and the account's
# scope is personal or team, the bound hosted project backs it up and can
# rehydrate it (push = backup; pull / config deploy = sync down). Git is not the
# recovery path.
# Runtime state (satelle.db, backups, stories cache) lives under
# ~/.satelle/<repo-key>/ — outside the repo. .satelle/logs is a symlink pointer
# to that logs directory and is listed here only when .satelle/ is not already ignored.
# Sync credentials and cursors live under ~/.config/satelle.
.satelle/satelle.local.toml
# this machine's agents override (command paths, profile= into ~/.satelle) never leaves the machine
.satelle/workflows/agents.local.toml
# the repo-local pinned binary (satelle update --local) is local state, never committed
.satelle/satelle
# agent story-reference dumps (edit-gate exempt via [gate] edit_exempt_globs)
sty_*_body.md
sty_*_ac.md
# <<< satelle (managed) <<<
